# GMS states it twice, ten points while Holy Symbol is up and ten more
# permanently, and this is the pair as one grant. Self only: GMS halves the
# while-up half for party members away from the caster, which needs positions
# this game doesn't have.
#
# Useless as it ships, like every resistance in the game: nothing inflicts a
# status or element. The stats page shows it so the player can see what the
# point bought.
name: "Holy Symbol - Preparation"
description:
  "Increases resistance to status ailments and all elements from using Holy "
  "Symbol."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BISHOP skill_order: 8 }
hyper: true
required_level: 165
max_level: 1
base {
  status_resistance: 20
  elemental_resistance: 0.20
}
